Table full name: AUSTIN.AUSTIN_311._311_SERVICE_REQUESTS
Column name: status Type: TEXT Description: Service request status. Duplicate statuses indicate that issue had previously been reported recently.
Column name: latitude Type: FLOAT Description: Service request location latitude coordinate.
Column name: close_date Type: NUMBER Description: Date Service request was closed.
Column name: status_change_date Type: NUMBER Description: Date of last Service request status change. Status changes occur when service request moves from one status to another. I.E. new to open, open to closed.
Column name: unique_key Type: TEXT Description: The service request tracking number.
Column name: city Type: TEXT Description: Parsed location information. City.
Column name: location Type: TEXT Description: Service request location latitude and longitude coordinates.
Column name: map_tile Type: TEXT Description: Service request location corresponding map tile.
Column name: county Type: TEXT Description: Parsed location information. County.
Column name: incident_address Type: TEXT Description: Service location of Service request.
Column name: state_plane_y_coordinate Type: FLOAT Description: State plane Y coordinate.
Column name: state_plane_x_coordinate Type: TEXT Description: State plane X coordinate.
Column name: street_name Type: TEXT Description: Parsed location information. Street name.
Column name: map_page Type: TEXT Description: Service request location corresponding map page.
Column name: last_update_date Type: NUMBER Description: Date Service request was updated. Last date Service request received updates. Updates may include creation, status changes, or changes to data in Service request.
Column name: created_date Type: NUMBER Description: Date Service request was created.
Column name: source Type: TEXT Description: Contact method Service request was received from. Mass entry requests are submitted by dept. in groups after work is completed.
Column name: incident_zip Type: TEXT Description: Parsed location information. Zip code.
Column name: longitude Type: FLOAT Description: Service request location longitude coordinate.
Column name: street_number Type: TEXT Description: Parsed location information. Street number.
Column name: council_district_code Type: NUMBER Description: Council district corresponding to Service request location. Locations outside of the City of Austin jurisdiction will not have a council district.
Column name: complaint_description Type: TEXT Description: Service request type
